# The base-image build-args of build/agentry-browser/Dockerfile, each mapped to
# its upstream ref. scripts/build.sh replaces each with our digest-pinned
# mirror and refuses to build if the ref is not in images.tsv.
#
# DEBIAN_IMAGE is the image's base: Debian 13 (trixie), whose archive builds
# Chromium from source. NODE_IMAGE is build-time only: it installs the
# server's packages from the lockfile, and its node binary (glibc, Node 24) is
# the only file the image takes from it, so no Debian nodejs is installed.
DEBIAN_IMAGE=debian:trixie-slim
NODE_IMAGE=node:24-bookworm-slim
